{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Find datasets"},"description":"Find open scientific datasets (and optionally models) that fit a research question, check their licences, verify the source papers (DOI, retractions, corrections), and return a citable Research Data Brief with a public share link. Searches DataCite (Zenodo, Figshare, Dryad and other data repositories), the Hugging Face Hub boosted by the Hugging Science curated index, and, for life-science questions, NCBI GEO, CZ CELLxGENE Discover (curated single-cell data) and the CZ CryoET Data Portal (cryo-electron tomography). Each result has a match level, a plain-language licence verdict, the source paper and whether it checks out, a citation for the data, and a line of code to load it. Every identifier comes from the repositories' own metadata; nothing is generated. The `why` field lists the facts behind the match: explain the fit to the user in your own words from those facts, and say plainly when the brief is empty. Pass `keywords` with English search words when the question is long or not in English. Licence verdicts come from repository metadata and are not legal advice.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"citation_style":{"default":"apa","description":"Style for the ready-made citations.","enum":["apa","mla","chicago","harvard","vancouver","ieee","ama"],"type":"string"},"domain":{"description":"Field of the question. Life-science domains also search NCBI GEO.","enum":["genomics","biology","medicine","chemistry","physics","earth_science","materials","engineering","other"],"type":"string"},"include_models":{"default":false,"description":"Also look for pretrained models on Hugging Face.","type":"boolean"},"intended_use":{"default":"publication","description":"What the data is for. `commercial` demotes anything its licence does not clear for commercial use.","enum":["thesis","publication","commercial","teaching"],"type":"string"},"keywords":{"description":"English search keywords (e.g. \"triple negative breast cancer RNA-seq\"). Recommended.","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"max_results":{"default":3,"description":"Number of results, 1\u20135.","maximum":5,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"question":{"description":"The research question in natural language (e.g. \"gene expression in triple-negative breast cancer\").","maxLength":1000,"minLength":3,"type":"string"}},"required":["question"],"type":"object"},"name":"find_datasets","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"intended_use":{"enum":["thesis","publication","commercial","teaching"],"type":"string"},"question":{"type":"string"},"quota":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"hint":{"enum":["low","intro"],"type":"string"},"limit":{"type":"integer"},"metric":{"enum":["verifications","calls"],"type":"string"},"plan":{"enum":["anon","free","pro"],"type":"string"},"resets":{"type":"string"},"upgrade":{"type":"string"},"used":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["plan","metric","used","limit","resets"],"type":"object"},"results":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"access":{"enum":["open","gated","unknown"],"type":"string"},"citation":{"type":"string"},"curated":{"type":"boolean"},"dataset_doi":{"type":"string"},"description":{"type":"string"},"format":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"id":{"type":"string"},"kind":{"enum":["dataset","model"],"type":"string"},"licence":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"label":{"type":"string"},"notes":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"spdx":{"type":"string"},"verdict":{"type":"string"}},"required":["verdict","label","notes"],"type":"object"},"load_snippet":{"type":"string"},"match":{"enum":["best","good","use_with_care"],"type":"string"},"matched_terms":{"items":{"type":"string"},"typ